---
description: Draft a scene artifact from its specific incoming reveal edges and identity-scoped knowledge state.
args: { candidate: SceneCandidate }
returns: DraftTheatreScene
---
Use the candidate's evidence slice and graph to draft only the scene's source-established intended beat, prerequisite facts, branch conditions, character knowledge, and knowledge by audience group. Cite the exact current production sources. Leave fields absent when evidence does not establish them. Include conflicting route claims explicitly and identify which exact reveal edge would need repair. Never fill a character's knowledge with facts known only to the narrator or the other audience group.
